This Agreement is made and entered into as of this ____ day of [_______, 200__ ] and effective as of the ____ day of [_______, 200__] (the “Effective Date”), by and between E-Next Generation LLC (“Purchaser”), a Delaware Limited Liability Company, acting through its agent Enron North America Corp., a corporation incorporated under the laws of the state of Delaware,  and General Electric Company, a corporation incorporated under the laws of New York,  (“Seller”).
RECITALS
WHEREAS, Purchaser has the need to acquire [      ] gas turbine generator package(s) (the “Units,” whether one or more) for a nominally rated [___] megawatt “MW” [simple/combined] cycle generation plant located near [ ,  ] the “Facility”), scheduled to be completed by [                     , 200_], and
WHEREAS, Seller is in the business of designing, engineering, manufacturing, and supplying gas turbine generator packages;
WHEREAS, Purchaser wishes to contract with Seller for the design, engineering, manufacture, and supply of the Units for the Facility and other services related thereto;
