Purchaser Supplied Information.  Except to the extent that the information provided by Purchaser to Seller is in the form of a specification or performance requirement specifically called out in this Agreement or performance requirements which Purchaser is obligated to provide under the Agreement, it is Seller’s responsibility to ensure that the information provided to Seller by Purchaser is accurate, correct, complete and fit for the particular purpose(s) for which Seller utilizes it.


