Exhibit N-1 sets forth a full reconciliation of the Purchase Amount.  Exhibit N-2 lists options of the Purchaser, prices and times by which the options must be exercised by Purchaser.  If an option is exercised by Purchaser, the applicable option amount shall be used to adjust the Purchase Amount.

Taxes and Contributions.

