[Seller’s Responsibility for Taxes].  Except as provided for in Section 5.2.3 Seller agrees to pay, and shall be responsible for, within the Purchase Amount, corporate income tax, export duties, Import Duties, customs clearance, sales taxes, or other similar taxes associated with the design, manufacture and Delivery of the Equipment and the performance of the Scope of Work assessed by any federal, state country, local or other legal taxing authority and any of its subdivisions, and to pay any and all valid sales or use taxes levied on general office, engineering and drafting supplies, materials, equipment, and services performed by Seller hereunder.] [Note: Parties’ tax counsel to discuss this]

