Tax Penalties.  Seller further agrees to pay any tax, interest, penalty, fines, costs, losses and expenses (including, without limitation, court costs and attorney’s fees) of whatever kind, which Purchaser may incur, be required by law to pay, or be liable for as a result of, arising from, in connection with, related to or based on any failure to withhold any amounts from any payments made or any amounts which Seller fails to pay in connection with, as a result of, arising from or based on the Scope of Work  or otherwise comply with this Section, except and to the extent such failure is attributable to Purchaser’s negligent act or failure to act, in which case Purchaser shall be responsible for and agrees to pay the portion of such tax related amounts as referred to above as are attributable to Purchaser’s negligent act or failure to act.

Changes to the Purchase Amount.  The Purchase Amount may only be adjusted in the following circumstances:

Change in Law requiring changes as provided in Section 3.6(c)(iv);
suspension pursuant to Section 5.5;
breach or default of this Agreement by Purchaser or Seller;
an Event of Force Majeure in which Purchaser is the Affected Party; exceeding a duration in the aggregate of thirty (30) Days in accordance with Section 18.9;
Change Orders issued pursuant to Article 11; 
Purchaser exercising options such as cancellation pursuant to Section 5.4. of this Agreement.
