Warranties Exclusive. The foregoing warranties are exclusive and are in lieu of all other warranties whether written, oral, implied or statutory.  NO IMPLIED STATUTORY WARRANTY OF MERCHANTABILITY OR FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE SHALL APPLY.

Remedies Exclusive. The preceding Sections of this Article set forth the exclusive remedies for all claims based on a breach of any of the foregoing warranties whether a claim, however instituted, is based on contract, indemnity, warranty, tort (including negligence), strict liability or otherwise.


