while on or entering the Site or other premises owned, leased, or occupied by Purchaser, search of personal and professional possessions, including but not limited to automobiles, trucks, briefcases, lunch boxes, and person for illegal drugs.  Failure to consent to such search shall be grounds for immediate removal from the Site or other premises owned, leased, or occupied by Purchaser;
drug testing at any time while on the Site or other premises owned, leased or occupied by Purchaser.  Failure to do so or failing any such test shall be grounds for immediate removal from the Site or other premises owned, leased, or occupied by Purchaser; and
